  "observer": "Generate and invoke an empty-constructor adapter on two actual classes.",
  "domainBasis": "Both selected classes have accessible argument-free constructors. A working public generator should produce a fresh instance with each requested class identity. An original runtime that cannot create the adapter remains open.",
